AD  - Doctoral School (I.O.S.U.D.), George Emil Palade University of Medicine, Pharmacy, Science, and Technology of Targu Mures, Targu Mures, 540142, Romania
AD  - Department of Laboratory Medicine, George Emil Palade University of Medicine, Pharmacy, Science, and Technology of Targu Mures, Targu Mures, 540142, Romania
