TI  - Feasibility of single-beat detection of ventricular late potentials on standard ECG leads via interpretable gradient boosting
PY  - 2026
T2  - Computer Methods and Programs in Biomedicine
VL  - 285
C7  - 109458
DO  - 10.1016/j.cmpb.2026.109458
