TI  - From outcrop observations to dynamic simulations: an efficient workflow for generating ensembles of geologically plausible fracture networks and assessing their impact on flow and transport
PY  - 2025
T2  - Geoenergy
VL  - 3
IS  - 1
C7  - geoenergy2025-028
DO  - 10.1144/geoenergy2025-028
