TI  - Opportunistic Osteoporosis Screening from Routine Knee Radiographs Using a Multi-Stage CNN Framework with External Validation
PY  - 2026
T2  - Journal of Clinical Medicine
VL  - 15
IS  - 13
C7  - 5222
