TI  - Dual-stream collaborative network (DSCN): Multimodal sentiment analysis via modality-invariant and modality-specific representation learning
PY  - 2025
T2  - Neurocomputing
VL  - 652
C7  - 131059
DO  - 10.1016/j.neucom.2025.131059
