AD  - Algae Bioseparation Research Laboratory, Department of Chemical Engineering and Materials Science, Yuan Ze University, Taoyuan, Taiwan
AD  - Design and Technology Centre, University of Technology Sarawak, No. 1, Jalan Universiti, Sarawak, Sibu, 96000, Malaysia
