AB  - A game changing innovation that delivers swift, precise eye care - protecting vision beforehand. The conventional approaches to diagnosing eye diseases are often inefficient and require expert intervention as well as financially burdensome, thus not optimal for widespread implementation. This study aims to discover a logical solution through the application of advanced intelligence approaches on a publicly available dataset containing 21,577 images categorized into ten classes. Prior to analysis, the dataset was processed and partitioned into training, testing and validation sets. However, the previous outcomes reached an accuracy of 89.64%, employing MobileNet model with Adam optimizer. On the contrary, our applied EfficientNetV2-M (92.50%) and ConvNeXt-Small (92.27%) with an attention mechanism to boost the accuracy through the ensemble of the models, obtained an accuracy of 93.5%, surpassing previous findings in effectiveness. Our method has the potential to be refined for clinical applications, assisting in prompt detection and intervention to prevent vision impairment. © 2025 IEEE.
