TI  - High Expression of THY1 in Intestinal Gastric Cancer as a Key Factor in Tumor Biology: A Poor Prognosis-Independent Marker Related to the Epithelial–Mesenchymal Transition Profile
PY  - 2024
T2  - Genes
VL  - 15
IS  - 1
C7  - 28
