TI  - Integrated Networks for Viscoelastic FWI: Mapping from Q to Relaxation Variables and Quantifying Modeling Error
PY  - 2024
T2  - IEEE Transactions on Geoscience and Remote Sensing
VL  - 62
C7  - 5935015
