AB  - The proceedings contain 9 papers. The special focus in this conference is on Reproducible Research in Pattern Recognition. The topics include: A Novel Pattern-Based Edit Distance for Automatic Log Parsing: Implementation and Reproducibility Notes; companion Paper: Deep Saliency Map Generators for Multispectral Video Classification; on Challenging Aspects of Reproducibility in Deep Anomaly Detection; On the Implementation of Baselines and Lightweight Conditional Model Extrapolation (LIMES) Under Class-Prior Shift; Combining Max-Tree and CNN for Segmentation of Cellular FIB-SEM Images; Automatic Forest Road Extraction from LiDAR Data Using Convolutional Neural Networks; Promoting Reproducibility of Research Results in International Events (Report from the 4th RRPR).
