AB  - We study generalization under labeled shift for categorical and general normed label spaces. We propose a series of methods to estimate the importance weights from labeled source to unlabeled target domain and provide confidence bounds for these estimators. We deploy these estimators and provide generalization bounds in the unlabeled target domain. © 1979-2012 IEEE.
