AD  - No. 1 Oil Production Company, Daqing Oilfield Company Limited, PetroChina, Daqing, China
AB  - Being water flooded for more than 6 decades, the Lasaxing Oilfield in Daqing is now developing in the extra-high water cut period and the ineffective water circulation (IWC) worsens year by year. Due to the heterogeneity and the gravity effect, there always exists high permeability channels at the bottom of the thick reservoir, which affects the water flooding efficiency greatly. As to the quantification of the IWC in thick reservoir, a novel method based on machine learning is promoted in this paper. Firstly, the reservoir classification model based on machine learning is given. 7 parameters of 60000 well-layer samples of the typical block are analyzed by means of PCA, and the clustering model is then constructed based on K-Means and manual intervention. The reservoir is then classified into 9 categories according to the interlayer position, the reservoir thickness, the reservoir permeability and etc. Secondly, the quantification method of the IWC in thick reservoir based on inspecting wells and machine learning is promoted. The reservoirs with highly water flooded section, which implies the IWC thickness, are taken as learning samples. The method of SVM and KNN is selected in the model training, which lead to a conformity rate of 75%. Thirdly, the method promoted is implemented in typical well groups, which shows that the percentage of ineffective thickness is 20–60%. The low-price and high-efficient profile controlling agent is then used in the stimulation pilot, which lead to an oil increasing of 3890t. The methodology promoted in this paper has the advantage of practical, short time of evaluating and easy-to-use, and presents an effective in the identification of the IWC. The method could also be used in other similar oilfields, which offers valuable reference for the effective development of a mature field at the extra-high water cut period. © 2022, The Author(s), under exclusive license to Springer Nature Singapore Pte Ltd.
