AB  - Brain shape deforms by aging and/or brain disorders. In order to reduce the radiologists' subjective evaluation, automated quantification method of brain magnetic resonance (MR) images is required. This paper introduces a machine learning algorithm into automated quantification of the brain morphology condition. The first application is to estimate the brain age, and the second application is to estimate Mini-Mental State Examination (MMSE). The method is applied to OASIS database. © 2016, Fuji Technology Press. All rights reserved.
