TI  - Adapting a classification rule to local and global shift when only unlabelled data are available
PY  - 2015
T2  - European Journal of Operational Research
VL  - 243
IS  - 1
SP  - 177
EP  - 189
DO  - 10.1016/j.ejor.2014.11.022
