AB  - The proceedings contain 62 papers. The special focus in this conference is on Applied Mechanics, Design, Modelling and Simulation, Control Systems and Materials Research. The topics include: Carbon fiber reinforced the cracking framework top side columns caused by roof temperature deformation; nanowelding of single walled carbon nanotubes onto electrodes using molecular dynamics method; preparation process of long fiber reinforced impact polypropylene copolymer composites; the mechanical properties of cement reinforced loess and pore microstructure characteristics; the study for non-destructive quantification method of reinforcement corrosion degree based on electrochemical detection and finite analysis technology; computational analysis of a magnetohydrodynamic flow in an electrically conducting hairpin duct; flow regime identification for wet gas flow based on kurtosis feature of flow-induced pipeline vibration; numerical modeling on low velocity impact on a foam core sandwich panel; research on the aero dynamicity of steady wing of non-parachute terminal sensitive projectile; stress analysis and applications of sucker rod in deviated wells; study on aftershocks triggering by static stress changes of the minxian-zhangxian 6.6 earthquake; study on the production decline laws for vertical fracture well in low-permeability gas reservoirs; the numerical simulation and performance analysis of the vortex pump for solid-liquid two phase medium; analysis of modal and seismic property of oil storage tanks; calculation of kill probability for kinetic energy rod against TBM warhead; design for disassembly based on substance-field analysis; overview of visualization tool as an experimental method in iterative participatory design; research for calculation model of allotypic pumping unit load; solving the deflection problem of laptop casing structure by finite difference method; numerical studies on the performance of saccardo ventilation system in emergency fire scenarios; design and optimization of urban signal fuzzy controller based on IQPSO; error modeling and simulation of serial-parallel mechanism based on screw theory; missile trajectory simulation in vertical plane; experimental verification of the suppression effect of ship shaft-rate electric field; modal analysis of a electric tool; an efficient quadratic conversion architecture for real-time wideband DDC; digital structural design and research of optical microscope; real-time suppression research of shaft-rate electric field based on the compensated negative potential; design of rate gyro stabilized platform control system; robotic fish technology and its applications to space mechatronics; design of automatic control system of floating dock; design of new intelligent redundant serial bus with isolated driver in the distributed control system; design of pneumatic and control system for quartz crystal tin dipping machine; study and application of sliding mode control strategy for high-power current source inverter; design of a communication interface between the controller and the galvanometer; reliability evaluation of main electrical connection of substation based on graph theory; mechanical disassembly of end-of-life products; influencing factors and evaluation standards of vibration on human comfort; capability based weapon system-of-systems evaluation strategies design space and exploratory analysis; risk evaluation in marine traffic systems based on fuzzy catastrophe theory; approximate evaluation of exact solutions of measurements inverse problems; scene classification based on improved spatial partition model and superconvergence analysis of finite element method for onlinear Klein-Gordon equation.
