AB  - With the explosive development of the Internet of things technology, IOT technology is used in agricultural production. Wireless sensor network(WSN) is a universal form of agricultural Internet of Things. It realizes fixed-point acquisition of data and storage of data. However, when it is applied to soil moisture monitoring, its sensor is easily damaged, resulting in incomplete data collection. In the presence of these problems, this paper put forward a kind solution of mobile sensing platform combined with cloud platform. The sensor, smart car, GPRS module, and cloud platform constitute a vegetable greenhouse environmental information cloud platform system. The system can realize environmental information monitoring in vegetable greenhouses. The sensor and smart car are used to build up mobile sensing platform. The GPRS module is responsible for transmitting the soil data to the cloud service platform through network transmission. The cloud service platform can receive data and store, classify, and count data. © 2018 IEEE.
